# How this module is found. ModuleDiscovery asks ServiceLoader, so adding this module to a build is adding a
# dependency and nothing else — there is no list anywhere to keep in step.
#
# The shade plugin merges these files across modules (ServicesResourceTransformer). Without that merge one
# module wins and the other is simply absent: no error, no log line, a feature missing.
de.raindancer.modules.pack.PackModule
